  "solution": "Gọi đường thẳng <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>:</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>1</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>1</mn></mfrac><mo>⇒</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>.</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow></semantics></math><br>\n\t\tGọi mặt phẳng <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> qua <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>M</mi></semantics></math> và vuông góc với <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>d</mi></semantics></math>. Khi đó <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> có vectơ pháp tuyến <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover><mi>n</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mrow><mo stretc